{"lyrics":"[00:01.40](Menoh)\n[00:01.64]Fuck, yeah\n[00:03.96]I got on designer fur (I got on designer fur), please call me sir (Sir KILL, yuh, yuh)\n[00:20.84]Last night was a blur (Night was a blur), don't wanna remember (Fuck), anything (Anything), anyway (Anyway)\n[00:25.70]I've been gave my heart away (I've been gave my heart away)\n[00:27.56]I don't listen, not one bit (One bit), hope it rots with that thot bitch (Thot bitch), death face\n[00:31.88]Never scarred, pop-punkstar (Pop-punkstar)\n[00:33.12]Don't have a heart (Don't have a heart), dead from the start (Dead from the start)\n[00:39.44]I'm a dark (Yeah-yeah) pop-punkstar (Pop-punkstar)\n[00:42.28]Been torn apart (Been torn apart), been torn apart (Been torn apart)\n[00:45.56]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm\n[00:46.08]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm\n[00:48.12]Lost my mind forever, I don't feel a thing (Mm-mm-mm)\n[00:50.72]Trust me, you're not clever, I see everything (Mm-mm-mm)\n[00:55.70]Seek revenge, it's endless, talk like you're not reckless\n[00:57.12]Stalking, you're a restless thot (Restless thot, yeah)\n[00:58.72]When my head hurts, I just pop more (I just pop more)\n[01:00.66]Punk ass kid in a four door (In a four door)\n[01:02.92]Stressed out, cryin' on the damn floor (On my damn floor)\n[01:06.46]I don't see the purpose comin' out my corridor (Corridor)\n[01:08.74]Never scarred, pop-punkstar (Pop-punkstar)\n[01:11.22]Don't have a heart (Don't have a heart), dead from the start (Dead from the start)\n[01:18.80]I'm a dark (Yuh) pop-punkstar (Pop-punkstar)\n[01:21.10]Been torn apart (Been torn apart), been torn apart (Been torn apart)\n[01:25.06]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm\n[01:25.58]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm\n[01:26.98]She's a rebel, yeah, wait, he's a rebel, yeah, hey\n[01:29.58]She's a rebel (Yuh), I'm the devil (Yuh)\n[01:31.14]Heart empty, but I got a head full (Got a head full)\n[01:35.86]No brains 'cause the pills got 'em scrambled (Scrambled)\n[01:40.48]Listening to Megadeth, watchin' Death Note (Watchin' Death Note)\n[01:43.50]Michael Phelps, hit her with the backstroke (Backstroke)\n[01:47.56]Collar round my neck, bark, but I won't choke (Won't choke)\n[01:51.14]No I won't go (Won't go), on my way home, rolling up dope, to the same songs\n[02:00.14]Codeine, fuego, lean a day old, yeah I love the taste (Love the taste)\n[02:02.02]Sip it 'til I go to sleep and drink it when I wake (When I wake)\n[02:03.82]Unload that choppa on 'em (Yuh), earthquake (Yuh, yuh)\n[02:05.20]Do a drive by while blasting Green Day, hey (Green Day)\n[02:07.02]Never scarred, pop-punkstar (Pop-punkstar)\n[02:08.20]Don't have a heart (Don't have a heart), dead from the start (Dead from the start)\n[02:10.62]I'm a dark (Yuh) pop-punkstar (Pop-punkstar)\n[02:11.82]Been torn apart (Been torn apart), been torn apart (Been torn apart)\n[02:13.96]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm\n[02:14.48]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm","words":[[1.4,1.5,"(Menoh)"],[1.64,1.72,"Fuck,"],[3.76,3.9,"yeah"],[3.96,3.96,"I"],[4.0,4.1,"got"],[7.48,7.5,"on"],[9.76,12.14,"designer"],[12.72,12.9,"fur"],[12.94,12.94,"(I"],[16.38,16.42,"got"],[16.48,16.5,"on"],[17.04,17.44,"designer"],[17.96,18.06,"fur),"],[18.16,18.96,"please"],[19.08,19.36,"call"],[19.62,19.7,"me"],[19.8,20.04,"sir"],[20.08,20.12,"(Sir"],[20.22,20.38,"KILL,"],[20.42,20.58,"yuh,"],[20.62,20.78,"yuh)"],[20.84,20.98,"Last"],[21.12,21.7,"night"],[22.66,22.82,"was"],[22.88,22.88,"a"],[22.98,23.04,"blur"],[23.08,23.22,"(Night"],[23.26,23.4,"was"],[23.44,23.44,"a"],[23.52,23.68,"blur),"],[23.76,23.9,"don't"],[24.0,24.18,"wanna"],[24.22,24.4,"remember"],[24.44,24.54,"(Fuck),"],[24.58,24.74,"anything"],[24.78,25.08,"(Anything),"],[25.18,25.34,"anyway"],[25.46,25.66,"(Anyway)"],[25.7,25.76,"I've"],[25.8,25.9,"been"],[25.98,26.14,"gave"],[26.22,26.26,"my"],[26.3,26.56,"heart"],[26.6,26.74,"away"],[26.78,26.86,"(I've"],[26.92,27.12,"been"],[27.16,27.22,"gave"],[27.26,27.28,"my"],[27.32,27.4,"heart"],[27.44,27.5,"away)"],[27.56,27.56,"I"],[27.72,27.86,"don't"],[27.9,28.16,"listen,"],[28.2,28.24,"not"],[28.28,28.34,"on